test-metrics/
# ...but keep the small, diffable machine-readable metric summaries committed as an
# additive baseline trail (see TESTING_STRATEGY.md §5/§7). Bulky/regenerated outputs
# (HTML reports, lcov) stay ignored above.
!test-metrics/
!test-metrics/coverage/
test-metrics/coverage/*
!test-metrics/coverage/coverage-summary.json
!test-metrics/mutation/
test-metrics/mutation/*
!test-metrics/mutation/mutation.json
